---
// Footer component for Chaud & Glace
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer
    class="border-t border-espresso-900 bg-espresso-950 text-white"
    aria-label="Pie de página de Chaud & Glace"
>
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12 sm:py-16">
        <!-- Main Row -->
        <div
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start md:justify-between gap-8 sm:gap-10 pb-10 border-b border-white/10"
        >
            <!-- Brand Column -->
            <div class="space-y-3.5">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div
                        class="flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-white/10 p-1.5 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/10 shrink-0"
                    >
                        <img
                            src="/logo/LogoChaud.png"
                            alt="Logotipo Chaud & Glace"
                            class="h-full w-full object-contain"
                            width="40"
                            height="40"
                        />
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h2
                            class="store-display text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white"
                        >
                            Chaud &amp; Glace
                        </h2>
                        <p
                            class="text-[0.65rem] font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-chaud-400"
                        >
                            Café con encanto
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-warm-200/90 max-w-sm">
                    Donde el sabor y la calidez existen en un mismo lugar. Café de especialidad y helados artesanales en Ciudad Serdán.
                </p>
            </div>

            <!-- Social Column -->
            <div class="space-y-3.5">
                <h3
                    class="text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-warm-300"
                >
                    Conecta con Nosotros
                </h3>
                <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5">
                    <a
                        href="https://www.facebook.com/share/1ApReivZHt/?mibextid=wwXIfr"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 min-h-[42px] text-xs font-bold text-white transition-all hover:border-chaud-400 hover:bg-chaud-600 active:scale-95"
                        aria-label="Seguir a Chaud & Glace en Facebook"
                    >
                        <span>Facebook</span>
                        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </a>

                    <a
                        href="https://www.instagram.com/chaud.and.glace?igsh=NHQ0dGF3bnpibGx0"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/5 px-4 py-2.5 min-h-[42px] text-xs font-bold text-white transition-all hover:border-chaud-400 hover:bg-chaud-600 active:scale-95"
                        aria-label="Seguir a Chaud & Glace en Instagram"
                    >
                        <span>Instagram</span>
                        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </a>

                    <a
                        href="https://wa.me/522451099498"
                        target="_blank"
                        rel="noopener noreferrer"
                        class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-emerald-500/40 bg-emerald-500/10 px-4 py-2.5 min-h-[42px] text-xs font-bold text-emerald-300 transition-all hover:bg-emerald-600 hover:text-white active:scale-95"
                        aria-label="Conversar en WhatsApp con Chaud & Glace"
                    >
                        <span>WhatsApp</span>
                        <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Copyright & Micro-notice -->
        <div
            class="mt-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-3 text-xs text-warm-300/80 text-center"
        >
            <p>
                © {currentYear} Chaud &amp; Glace • Todos los derechos reservados.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</footer>
